{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"李小龍86歲冥壽　星光大道辦紀念獻花儀式\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/LEE-FLOWER-261127-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】今日是已故武打巨星李小龍86歲冥壽，在尖沙咀星光大道有紀念獻花儀式。</p><p>有市民穿上李小龍經典黃黑戲服鞠躬，獻上花束致意，亦有人用手機拍下銅像，懷緬一代武打巨星。</p><p>儀式於尖沙咀星光大道李小龍銅像前舉行，由李小龍會主席、李小龍胞弟李振輝伉儷主持。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:24:03.433363+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:24:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T01:17:23.507944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:17:29.903705+00:00","content_hash":"b231988485d21eee0ce438db2fe7ea68b776a222543e9f795a8e06fa9dd97f7a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}